#: ../../../integration/ide/codeanywhere.rst:15
msgid "Codeanywhere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/codeanywhere.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Codeanywhere <https://codeanywhere.com>`_ is a Cross Platform Cloud IDE and "
"it has all the features of Desktop IDE but with additional features only a "
"cloud application can give you! Codeanywhere is very flexible and you can "
"set up your workflow any way you want it. The elegant development "
"environment will let you focus on building great applications quicker. All "
"the features you will need for any coding task are built into Codeanywhere, "
"making development more productive and fun."
msgstr ""

